---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import FeeSchedule from '../components/FeeSchedule.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Services and Fees | Tallybrook Tax Service, Columbus"
  description="Tax returns for individuals, families, the self-employed and landlords in Columbus, Ohio, with flat fees and Ohio, city and school district returns included."
>
  <section class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>Services and fees</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Most of our clients are families, retirees, and people who work for themselves. If that's you,
      we can handle all of it, including the Ohio and city returns.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="wrap split split--narrow-left">
      <div>
        <h2>Every fee we charge</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">
          You'll know your fee before we start. If your return turns out to be simpler than we
          thought, the fee goes down.
        </p>
        <p>We take cash, checks and all major cards. You can also have the fee taken out of your refund.</p>
      </div>
      <FeeSchedule />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band">
    <div class="wrap split split--narrow-left">
      <h2>What we do</h2>
      <ul class="ruled">
        <li>
          <h3>Personal returns</h3>
          <p>
            W-2 income, retirement, Social Security, investments and everything that comes with
            them. We check for every credit you qualify for, including the child tax credit and the
            earned income credit.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Self-employed and gig work</h3>
          <p>
            Rideshare, delivery, cleaning, contracting, a shop on Etsy. We sort your income and
            expenses, work out your mileage and home office, and set up your quarterly payments so
            next April isn't a surprise.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Rental property</h3>
          <p>
            Rent, repairs, depreciation and the paperwork that goes with them, for one property or a
            few.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Ohio, city and school district returns</h3>
          <p>
            Every federal return we prepare comes with your Ohio return, your city return and, if
            your district has one, your school district return. They're part of the fee.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Catching up on past years</h3>
          <p>
            Missed a year or two? We'll prepare the late returns, find out what you owe or are owed,
            and set up a payment plan with the IRS if you need one.
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>IRS and state letters</h3>
          <p>
            Bring us the letter. If we prepared the return, we answer it for free. If we didn't,
            we'll look at it and tell you what it would cost before we do anything.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="band band--white">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>Open after April, too</h2>
        <p class="lede" style="margin-top:1rem">
          Tax questions don't stop on April 15. We keep the office open two days a week the rest of
          the year.
        </p>
      </div>
      <ul class="ruled">
        <li>
          <h3>Extensions</h3>
          <p>We file your extension by the deadline and finish your return by October.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Quarterly estimates</h3>
          <p>We send self-employed clients a reminder and the amount before each payment is due.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <h3>Life changes</h3>
          <p>
            Getting married, having a baby, buying a house or retiring? Stop in and we'll tell you
            how it changes your taxes.
          </p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
